<!--
================================================================================
 studio.srv  --  the members page (served only to a valid session)
================================================================================
 Reaching this page requires a valid session cookie, set by logging in with a
 client key on the homepage. A guest is given a plain 404 (see srvsite.go), so
 the page's existence is not advertised.

 This page is deliberately minimal: it proves the session works and is a
 natural home for members-only tooling.
================================================================================
-->

<style>
	#studio-wrap {
		background-color: var(--ink-panel);
		border-radius: 10px;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
		padding: 1.5em;
		margin: 1.5em 0;
		color: var(--ink);
	}
</style>

<div id="studio-wrap">
	<h2>Members area</h2>
	<p>
		You are signed in. This page is only served to a valid session; a guest
		requesting <code>/studio</code> receives a 404.
	</p>
	<p>
		Identity is carried by an HttpOnly session cookie, never by the URL.
		Sessions persist across restarts in <code>sessions.json</code>.
	</p>
	<p>
		<a class="pj-submit" href="logout" style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;">Log out</a>
	</p>
	<p class="srv-gold">
		For technical support or managed hosting, visit SRVpress.com.
	</p>
</div>
